@startuml kairos-member-registration-onboarding-sequence
title Member Registration and Onboarding

actor "Prospective Member" as Prospect
participant "Member App" as MemberApp
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB
participant "Auth Provider" as Auth

Prospect -> MemberApp: Open Registration Page
MemberApp -> API: GET /branches
API -> DB: SELECT branches
DB --> API: Branch list
API --> MemberApp: Branch list

Prospect -> MemberApp: Fill registration form\nSubmit
MemberApp -> API: POST /members/register {details}
API -> DB: INSERT Member, User (pending)
DB --> API: {memberId, userId}
API -> Auth: Create auth user (email/password)
Auth --> API: OK
API --> MemberApp: 201 Created {memberId}

' First login
Prospect -> MemberApp: Enter credentials
MemberApp -> API: POST /auth/login
API -> Auth: Validate
Auth --> API: OK + roles=[Member]
API -> DB: SELECT Member summary
DB --> API: Member profile
API --> MemberApp: 200 OK {jwt, profile}

MemberApp --> Prospect: Show Onboarding Tutorial\n(skippable)
Prospect -> MemberApp: Skip / Finish
MemberApp --> Prospect: Redirect to Member Dashboard

@enduml
